<title>USA: Unisys Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Unisys Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>BLUE BELL, Pa. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr prim profit $0.08	  loss	$4.12</p>
<p> Shr dil profit   0.08	  loss	 4.12</p>
<p> Net profit	  43,600     loss	 676,800</p>
<p> Revs		1,811,500		 1,865,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary 174,028		  171,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted 174,028		  171,400</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS ENDED DECEMBER 31</p>
<p> Shr prim loss   $0.41	  loss    $4.35</p>
<p> Shr dil loss	0.41	 loss     4.35</p>
<p> Net profit	   49,700    loss	624,600</p>
<p> Revs		6,370,500		6,342,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary 172,601		  171,238</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted  172,601		 171,238</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate Q4 profit $0.13</p>
<p>First Call mean estimate annual loss $0.36</p>
<p>NOTE: Unisys reported fourth-quarter net income of $55.7 million, before an extraordinary charge, compared to net income of $3.5 million before special charges in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Before these charges, fourth-quarter earnings per share were $0.15 after payment of preferred dividends, versus a loss of $0.16 a year ago.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk</p>
</text>
